From 8f6615eb62c2fadebe13ab78dd92edc7023e7ce0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jev-router-ci <jev-router-ci@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:24:01 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] plugins: send route provenance headers for plugin-routed
 combos

When a plugin-routed combo dispatches the successful attempt, stamp the response head with x-omniroute-route (the exact combo target), x-omniroute-attempts (attempt count), x-router-reason (jev|static[:cont]) and x-router-confidence (0..1, only when Jev's pick was applied). The onRoute result now carries confidence alongside reason. Routing metadata only; failed combos get no route headers.
